## Summary: When to Use Each Refactoring Pattern

| Pattern | Use When |
|---------|----------|
| **Extract Method** | Long methods, code duplication, complex nested logic |
| **Replace Conditional with Polymorphism** | Complex if/else chains based on type or state |
| **Introduce Parameter Object** | Functions with many parameters, related parameters |
| **Replace Magic Numbers** | Hardcoded values that should be named constants |
| **Chain Constructors** | Multiple constructors with overlapping logic |
| **Extract Class** | God objects, classes with too many responsibilities |
| **Move Method** | Features that don't belong in current class |
| **Inline Class** | Classes that don't justify their existence |
| **Replace Inheritance with Delegation** | Inheritance used for code reuse rather than "is-a" |
| **Introduce Null Object** | Repeated null checks, default behavior |
| **Introduce Assertion** | Preconditions that should be validated |
| **Decompose Conditional** | Complex conditional logic |
| **Consolidate Conditional Expression** | Multiple conditions leading to same action |
| **Consolidate Duplicate Conditional Fragments** | Same code in all branches of conditional |
| **Remove Dead Code** | Unused code, commented-out code |
| **Rename** | Poorly named variables, functions, classes |
| **Simplify Method Calls** | Confusing API, method names don't match behavior |
| **Separate Query from Modifier** | Functions with side effects |
| **Parameterize Method** | Similar methods differing only in literal values |
| **Preserve Whole Object** | Passing multiple fields from same object |
| **Replace Error with Exception** | Error handling that should be exceptions |
| **Extract Surrounding Method** | Repeated code before/after method calls |
| **Optimization** | Performance improvements, memory efficiency |
| **Context Manager** | Resource management, cleanup code |
| **Strategy Pattern** | Multiple algorithms for same task |
| **Observer Pattern** | Event handling, notifications |
| **State Machine** | State-dependent behavior, workflows |

